<p style="font-size:14px;">
  The card we have on file for <strong><%= @organization.name %></strong>'s
  Pharma Transport subscription &mdash; the one ending
  <strong><%= @card[:last4] %></strong> &mdash; expires <strong><%= @expires %></strong>.
</p>

<p style="font-size:14px;">
  Update it before your next renewal so your subscription doesn't lapse. A failed
  renewal charge would suspend Compliance Packet generation beyond your free
  allowance, your verification badge, and SMS temperature alerts until it's fixed.
</p>

<p style="font-size:14px;">
  <%= link_to "Update your card", billing_url %>
</p>

<p style="font-size:12px; color:#666;">
  Already replaced it? You can ignore this. You're getting this because you're an
  admin on this organization.
</p>
